@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = paste-user-token-here
@adminToken = paste-admin-token-here
@orderNo = paste-order-no-here
@paymentNo = paste-payment-no-here

### 1. 注册普通用户
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demo_user",
  "password": "Demo@123456",
  "phone": "13900000001",
  "email": "demo@mall.local"
}

### 2. 登录普通用户，将 data.accessToken 填到 token 变量
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demo_user",
  "password": "Demo@123456"
}

### 3. 查询商品（公开接口）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?page=1&size=20

### 4. 查询分类（公开接口）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories

### 5. 搜索商品（索引首次同步最多等待约 10 秒）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search/products?keyword=华为&page=1&size=10

### 6. 加入购物车
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1001,
  "quantity": 2
}

### 7. 查询购物车
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. 创建订单。重复发送同一个 requestNo 应返回同一个订单
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestNo": "demo-order-0001",
  "receiverName": "张三",
  "receiverPhone": "13900000001",
  "receiverAddress": "上海市浦东新区演示路 1 号"
}

### 9. 模拟支付，将 data.paymentNo 填到 paymentNo 变量
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/orders/{{orderNo}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. 查询订单，Outbox 消息消费后状态应为 PAID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderNo}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. 管理员登录，将 data.accessToken 填到 adminToken
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Admin@123456"
}

### 12. 管理员查询订单
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/orders?page=1&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 13. 管理员发货
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/orders/{{orderNo}}/ship
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 14. 用户确认收货
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderNo}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 15. 创建秒杀活动，时间按实际测试时间修改
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/seckill/activities
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1001,
  "activityName": "晚八点手机秒杀",
  "seckillPrice": 4999.00,
  "totalStock": 100,
  "limitPerUser": 1,
  "startTime": "2026-07-19T20:00:00",
  "endTime": "2026-07-19T23:59:59"
}
